Package: descriptiveStats
Title: Descriptive Statistics Package
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Lily", "Langstone-Bolt",
    email = "lilybolt@mac.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Description: Provides functions for calculating common descriptive
    statistics for numeric vectors, including the mean, median, mode,
    quartiles and interquartile range, with appropriate handling of
    missing values and edge cases.
